Z||000004||tgowens||07-22-2000||09:34 PM||||Majik, unfortunately, your site has been coded using HTML codes unrecognized by Netscape therefore eliminating a great majority of your intended audience. It is viewable in Explorer but not in Netscape. Cross-platform functionality is often overlooked by many web designers as they tend to forget that there is not yet an HTML standard and accordingly code their pages to the browser they use. -- this is the reason why Cliff and fieroshop are unable to view your site. -- hope this helps.........<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">                 <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A><P>[This message has been edited by tgowens (edited 07-22-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by tgowens (edited 07-22-2000).]||||reg||1
